      {
        "@value": "State of a <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#JointMeasurement>. Four individuals: JMPendingContractor (initial, awaiting contractor OTP), JMPendingDepartmental (contractor signed, awaiting JE/AE), JMComplete (both signed, legally binding), JMRejected (either party rejected)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
